TITLE Pyrite oxidation equilibrium; pH 7; log pO2=-0.7; allow goethite+gypsum
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)   -0.7  10
    Pyrite  0     0.1
    Goethite 0    0
    Gypsum   0    0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file pyrite_ox_sel.csv
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -totals Fe S Ca
    -si Goethite Gypsum Pyrite
USER_PUNCH
    -headings SC_uScm
10 PUNCH SC
END
